A Markdown file without frontmatter prints its first heading.
== args
input/**/*
== file input/docs/guide.md
---
summary: Guide overview.
---

# Guide
== file input/src/with-comment.md
---
description: Utility helpers for HTTP requests.
---
# fetcher
== file input/src/no-summary.md
# value
== file input/misc/raw.txt
plain text
